{"attack":"太晶化时，会放出太晶属性的能量攻击。比较自己的攻击和特攻，用数值相对较高的一项给予对方伤害。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害。\n太晶化时若使用者的攻击大于特攻，则该招式变为物理招式。\n\n在判定招式分类为物理或特殊时，仅考虑使用者的能力及能力变化，不考虑特性、携带道具或灼伤状态的影响。\n当使用者未太晶化时，该招式为一般属性，受皮肤类特性影响；使用者太晶化后，该招式属性变为使用者的太晶属性，且即使宝可梦的太晶属性为一般属性，该招式也不受皮肤类特性影响。\n使用者太晶化为星晶属性时，太晶爆发的威力由80提升至100，属性变为星晶，造成无属性伤害，对非太晶化的任何属性的目标造成1倍伤害，对太晶化的对手造成2倍的效果绝佳伤害。使用后令使用者的攻击降低1级。令使用者的特攻降低1级。","levelUpMoves":[],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":[],"tmMoves9":["Bulbasaur","Ivysaur","Venusaur","Charmander","Charmeleon","Charizard","Squirtle","Wartortle","Blastoise","Ekans","Arbok","Raichu","Raichu form:alolan","Sandshrew","Sandshrew form:alolan","Sandslash","Sandslash form:alolan","Clefairy","Clefable","Vulpix","Vulpix form:alolan","Ninetales","Ninetales form:alolan","Jigglypuff","Wigglytuff","Oddish","Gloom","Vileplume","Venonat","Venomoth","Diglett","Diglett form:alolan","Dugtrio","Dugtrio form:alolan","Meowth","Meowth form:alolan","Meowth form:galarian","Persian","Persian form:alolan","Psyduck","Golduck","Mankey","Primeape","Growlithe","Growlithe form:hisuian","Arcanine","Arcanine form:hisuian","Poliwag","Poliwhirl","Poliwrath","Bellsprout","Weepinbell","Victreebel","Tentacool","Tentacruel","Geodude","Geodude form:alolan","Graveler","Graveler form:alolan","Golem","Golem form:alolan","Slowpoke","Slowpoke form:galarian","Slowbro","Slowbro form:galarian","Magnemite","Magneton","Doduo","Dodrio","Seel","Dewgong","Grimer","Grimer form:alolan","Muk","Muk form:alolan","Shellder","Cloyster","Gastly","Haunter","Gengar","Drowzee","Hypno","Voltorb","Voltorb form:hisuian","Electrode","Electrode form:hisuian","Exeggcute","Exeggutor","Exeggutor form:alolan","Hitmonlee","Hitmonchan","Koffing","Weezing","Weezing form:galarian","Rhyhorn","Rhydon","Chansey","Horsea","Seadra","Scyther","Electabuzz","Magmar","Tauros","Tauros form:paldean_combat","Tauros form:paldean_blaze","Tauros form:paldean_aqua","Gyarados","Lapras","Eevee","Vaporeon","Jolteon","Flareon","Porygon","Snorlax","A